{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "Winding Path to Victory",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bde3c47ede5f2b2de9a2ab2a3c12f006e4a1768d3db907b62c68037681239d9c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As we follow the event's progress, the leading team has already passed the cycling checkpoint, and it's now that we're seeing a change in the contest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After the might-and-power LUNG wRATh of Round 1 passed the cycling checkpoint and got to riding, another team's immediately begun to personally deal with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And moreover, they seem to have changed strategies this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lady Candela, can we invite you to explain to everyone, please!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't it clear? This bunch know that even attacking all at once doesn't ensure they're an opponent to the team, so they've elected to stall them out, and not to overpower them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tactics like that put you up very close to those two in the footrace, but plenty of moves get tricky to pull when you're on a vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So here in the cycling segment is where they're opting to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It goes without saying, the results aren't bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Without a doubt. They've gotten just close enough to LUNG wRATh, without moving up to attack. It's been trick after trick to harass them, giving them no way to comfortably pick up the pace."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can see just how far behind the leading team LUNG wRATh is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're stuck with a handicap on their bikes, and getting off means falling behind! LUNG wRATh face their biggest crisis in the competition yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're not trying to defeat us, just stall us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the plan? We're hard-pressed to try combat cycling. We'll be completely held up at this rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) It seems someone wants us to take a shortcut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) I'm on the same page."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) Go for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "LUNG wRATh have chosen to charge straight through an alley to shake the other teams off them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But just as we saw on another stage, our city's crack troops wait in the alleys!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Though I'd love to cover the other teams too, LUNG wRATh has completely captured our attention!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have they brought on their own doom, or will they survive the odds? We're going to find out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This way! This is a pretty quiet alley, so I reckon nobody..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The moment Ernesto turns back to look, a crossbow bolt flies out at him from a corner, but is cut down by a chop from Lin Yühsia."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ambush A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ambush B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Leave this to me, and hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As Ernesto talks, he throws a key to Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) Hold onto this key."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) There's an arms store of mine over there. It should be there the moment you head out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) There's a back door in the basement leading to an underground passage. It'll be way faster along that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hushed) I'll hold them off here. Go on ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Will you be fine by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as one of us makes it to the end, that's our win! Go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We break out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
